C CUST-10000317: Subject: Your Gold Member Perks Are Waiting – Free Shipping on Your Next Order
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Gold member, you enjoy free standard shipping on every order—no minimum spend required—plus free return shipping on items that don't work out, making it easy to shop outdoor gear and footwear risk-free online. Come back and rediscover what you love about NorthStar, and let us know if you have questions about your account.
C CUST-10000904: Subject: Your Bronze Member Apparel Offer – Free Shipping on Your Next Order
Body: We'd love to see you back in our apparel collection. As a Bronze member, you'll enjoy free standard shipping on orders of $75 or more—making it easier to refresh your outdoor wardrobe online or in store. Shop apparel this week and take advantage of the savings.
C CUST-10000122: Subject: Your Platinum Perks Are Waiting—Free Gear Repair & Exclusive Support
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Platinum member, you enjoy unlimited free gear repair on outdoor and electronics purchases—a benefit that pays for itself quickly on high-quality items. Reach out to our dedicated Platinum support line to schedule a repair or explore new arrivals in your favorite categories, and we'll make sure you get the expert service you deserve.
C CUST-10000588: Subject: Your Silver Rewards Are Waiting – Free Shipping on Home Essentials
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Silver member, you enjoy free standard shipping on orders of $50 or more—perfect for stocking up on home goods, one of your favorite categories. Shop now and let your rewards work for you.

