CB CUST-10000317: Subject: Your Gold Member Perks Are Waiting—Free Shipping on Your Next Order
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Gold member, you enjoy free standard shipping on every order—no minimum spend required—plus free return shipping on items that don't work out, making it easy to shop outdoor gear and footwear risk-free. Come back to NorthStar and rediscover what you love, with benefits that make online shopping simpler.
CB CUST-10000904: Subject: We Miss You – Easier Returns on Your Apparel Favorites
Body: We noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Bronze member, you enjoy free standard shipping on apparel orders of $75 or more—and to make returns even simpler, we're offering you free return shipping on your next purchase. Shop apparel in-store or online, and if you need to make a return, we'll cover the cost to send it back.
CB CUST-10000122: Subject: Your Platinum Perks Are Waiting—Free Gear Repair & Exclusive Support
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Platinum member, you enjoy unlimited free gear repair on outdoor and electronics purchases—a benefit that pays for itself quickly on high-quality equipment. Reach out to our dedicated Platinum support line to schedule a repair or explore new arrivals in your favorite categories, and we'll make sure you're taken care of.
CB CUST-10000588: Subject: We Miss You – Extra Rewards on Your Favorite Home Picks
Body: It's been a while since we've seen you, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Silver member, you earn 1.25× points on every purchase—and if you spend $50 or more, you'll qualify for free standard shipping on your order. Come browse our Home collection and let us know what brings you back.

