A CUST-10000317: Subject: Your Gold Member Perks Are Waiting – Free Shipping on Your Next Order
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Gold member, you enjoy free standard shipping on every order—no minimum spend required—plus free return shipping on eligible items, making it easy to shop outdoor gear and footwear risk-free. Come back to NorthStar and rediscover what you love.
A CUST-10000904: Subject: We miss you—earn extra points on your next apparel purchase
Body: It's been a while since we've seen you in store, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Bronze member, you earn 1× points on every purchase—and your points never expire as long as you keep shopping with us. Stop by NorthStar or visit northstar.com to browse our apparel selection, and let's get you back on track with rewards that add up.
A CUST-10000122: Subject: Your Platinum Perks Are Waiting—Gear Repair & Free Returns on Your Next Order
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Platinum member, you enjoy unlimited free gear repair and a 60-day return window on eligible purchases—benefits that make outdoor and electronics gear easier to try and maintain. Shop your favorite categories and take advantage of these exclusive perks on us.
A CUST-10000588: Subject: Earn More on Your Next Home Purchase — Silver Member Bonus
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Silver member, you earn 1.25× points on every purchase—and your next order of home goods qualifies for free standard shipping on orders $50+. Stop by a store or shop online at northstar.com to start earning toward your next reward.

