B CUST-10000317: Subject: Your Gold Member Benefit: Free Returns on Your Next Order
Body: We'd love to have you back, and we're making it easier with a reminder of your Gold member perk—free return shipping on your next purchase. Whether you're stocking up on outdoor gear or finding your next pair of footwear, you can shop with confidence knowing returns are on us. Visit northstar.com or stop by one of our 400 stores to explore what's new.
B CUST-10000904: Subject: We Miss You — Special Offer Inside for Your Next Apparel Purchase
Body: We noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd love to welcome you back. As a Bronze member, we're offering you 15% off your next apparel purchase — valid both online and in any of our 400 stores for 45 days from today. Stop by or shop at northstar.com to redeem this offer on your account and discover what's new in our apparel collection.
B CUST-10000122: Subject: Your Platinum Advantage: Free Returns on Your Next Outdoor Purchase
Body: We'd love to have you back. As a Platinum member, you enjoy free return shipping on orders—a benefit that makes trying new gear risk-free. We've noticed you love Outdoor and Electronics, so we're inviting you to explore our latest collection in those categories with the confidence that returns are always on us.
B CUST-10000588: Subject: We'd Love to Welcome You Back — Silver Member Exclusive
Body: We've noticed it's been a while since your last visit, and we'd like to bring you back with an offer tailored to you. As a Silver member, you enjoy free returns to any of our 400 stores — a convenient way to shop Home and Beauty items risk-free. We'd be delighted to see you again soon; simply visit northstar.com or your nearest store to explore what's new.

